answering.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the presence of an orientation/laterality marker and note which image side it labels.\",\n    \"Verify that the grounded coordinates' image-side matches the patient-side implied by the marker before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":448,"total_tokens":833,"completion_tokens":385,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":448},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":385}}}